{
    "chapter_num": 1,
    "verses_count": 21,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Greeting the Faithful"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Simon Peter, a bondservant and apostle of Jesus Christ,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To those who have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "received"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "obtained like"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "faith of the same value"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " precious faith with us by the righteousness of our God and Savior Jesus Christ:"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Grace and peace be multiplied to you in the knowledge of God and of Jesus our Lord, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "as His divine power has given to us all things that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "pertain"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to life and godliness, through the knowledge of Him who called us by glory and virtue, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "by which have been given to us exceedingly great and precious promises, that through these you may be partakers of the divine nature, having escaped the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "depravity"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "corruption "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the world through lust."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Fruitful Growth in the Faith"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But also for this very reason, giving all diligence, add to your faith virtue, to virtue knowledge, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to knowledge self-control, to self-control "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "patience"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perseverance, to perseverance godliness, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to godliness brotherly kindness, and to brotherly kindness love. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if these things are yours and abound, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " will be neither "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "useless"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "barren nor unfruitful in the knowledge of our Lord Jesus Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he who lacks these things is shortsighted, even to blindness, and has forgotten that he was cleansed from his old sins."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, brethren, be even more diligent to make your call and election sure, for if you do these things you will never stumble; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for so an entrance will be supplied to you abundantly into the everlasting kingdom of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Peter’s Approaching Death"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this reason I will not be negligent to remind you always of these things, though you know and are established in the present truth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yes, I think it is right, as long as I am in this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Body"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "tent, to stir you up by reminding "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "knowing that shortly I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "must"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Die and leave this body"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "put off my tent, just as our Lord Jesus Christ showed me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover I will be careful to ensure that you always have a reminder of these things after my "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. exodus, departure"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "decease."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Trustworthy Prophetic Word"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we did not follow cunningly devised fables when we made known to you the power and coming of our Lord Jesus Christ, but were eyewitnesses of His majesty. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For He received from God the Father honor and glory when such a voice came to Him from the Excellent Glory: “This is My beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we heard this voice which came from heaven when we were with Him on the holy mountain."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or We also have the more sure prophetic word"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And so we have the prophetic word confirmed, which you do well to heed as a light that shines in a dark place, until the day dawns and the morning star rises in your hearts; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "knowing this first, that no prophecy of Scripture is of any private "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or origin"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "interpretation, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for prophecy never came by the will of man, but "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU men spoke from God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "holy men of God spoke "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as they were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " moved by the Holy Spirit."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}